    <item>
      <title>UCB Bimzelx vs AbbVie Skyrizi</title>
      <link>https://www.google.com</link>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Summary:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;UCB&lt;/b&gt; presented data showing &lt;b&gt;Bimzelx (bimekizumab)&lt;/b&gt; achieved a head-to-head win over &lt;b&gt;AbbVie&lt;/b&gt;’s &lt;b&gt;Skyrizi (risankizumab)&lt;/b&gt; in a clinical trial, demonstrating superior efficacy in an immunology indication (likely psoriasis or psoriatic arthritis).&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;MoAs:&lt;/b&gt; Bimzelx: dual IL-17A and IL-17F inhibitor; Skyrizi: IL-23p19 inhibitor.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.fiercepharma.com/pharma/ucb-presents-data-bimzelxs-head-head-win-over-abbvies-skyrizi"&gt;Fierce Pharma&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
